  "label": "Savanna Environment",
  "description": "The setting is a savanna, a grassland biome with scattered trees, typical of East Africa. This environment is not inherently indicative of starvation or lack of food; it is a natural habitat for pastoralist communities who have adapted to it. The meme uses this setting to imply that the environment is barren or hostile to food, which is a misrepresentation of the ecological and cultural context.",
